00:26:38.950 --> 00:26:40.230
Yes, that's it.

00:26:40.230 --> 00:26:41.990
No, seriously.

00:26:41.990 --> 00:26:45.620
What is it?

00:26:45.620 --> 00:26:46.770
I don't know.

00:27:00.350 --> 00:27:14.690
-We know you! -You're Carlybeth, aren't you? You scared us!

00:27:14.690 --> 00:27:20.690
We were looking for you. This is Carlybeth's head.

00:27:20.690 --> 00:27:29.320
Poor thing didn't want to lose her head, but I took it off!

00:27:31.050 --> 00:27:33.050
How can you put that strange voice?

00:27:33.050 --> 00:27:37.050
Apologize, apologize to Carly and Bert.

00:27:37.050 --> 00:27:40.330
Apologize? Why?

00:27:40.330 --> 00:27:43.650
Because of the times you scared her.

00:27:43.650 --> 00:27:45.650
Because of the times you made her laugh.

00:27:45.650 --> 00:27:47.650
We were just doing the stupid thing.

00:27:47.650 --> 00:27:49.510
We did it because we liked it.

00:27:49.510 --> 00:27:54.620
Excuse me, so it doesn't show that you like someone.

00:27:54.620 --> 00:27:56.540
Leave us alone.

00:27:56.540 --> 00:27:59.210
Yes, that.

00:27:59.210 --> 00:28:00.000
Apologize.

00:28:06.430 --> 00:28:08.700
What do you want?

00:28:08.700 --> 00:28:10.960
I want to live.

00:28:10.960 --> 00:28:13.320
Forgive us, we will never do it again.

00:28:14.290 --> 00:28:15.620
Help me.

00:28:16.930 --> 00:28:17.660
I...

00:28:17.660 --> 00:28:18.750
I have spoken.

00:28:19.980 --> 00:28:23.010
Please help me.

00:28:23.010 --> 00:28:24.770
No, no, no!

00:30:09.720 --> 00:30:14.480
Everywhere. Where is life?

00:30:14.480 --> 00:30:17.640
You worried me.

00:30:17.640 --> 00:30:20.580
And those hands?

00:30:20.580 --> 00:30:23.300
I fell in the mud.

00:30:23.300 --> 00:30:26.620
And your sculpture?

00:30:26.620 --> 00:30:27.620
I don't have it anymore.

00:30:27.620 --> 00:30:30.000
What do you mean you don't have it?

00:30:30.000 --> 00:30:31.030
Don't look at me like that.

00:30:31.030 --> 00:30:33.030
Have you seen Chuck and Steve?

00:30:33.030 --> 00:30:36.170
Uh... Yes.

00:30:36.170 --> 00:30:38.810
Have they scared you?

00:30:38.810 --> 00:30:40.410
I think so.

00:30:40.410 --> 00:30:41.720
You haven't done anything to them?

00:30:41.720 --> 00:30:45.420
No, of course not.

00:30:45.420 --> 00:30:47.220
Let's go home.

00:31:08.350 --> 00:31:10.500
- Wow. - Yes.

00:31:10.500 --> 00:31:14.700
But I have to share them with my cousin. She's upset and couldn't go out.

00:31:14.700 --> 00:31:20.490
- I have to take this off. I'm sweating. - Good idea.

00:31:20.490 --> 00:31:30.000
- What's going on? - The mask won't come off. - Really?

00:31:30.700 --> 00:31:34.700
- Can you take it off? - It's like I have it stuck to my skin.

00:31:34.700 --> 00:31:39.700
- If we have to call the firemen to take it off, we'll make a fool of ourselves. - Shut up and help me!

00:31:39.700 --> 00:31:50.470
- Is it stuck? - Be careful, it hurts a lot.

00:31:50.470 --> 00:31:57.230
- Maybe you can cut it with scissors or a knife. - No, no, no, it's dangerous.

00:31:57.230 --> 00:32:00.000
- I don't care, Sabrina. I'm sorry.

00:32:00.540 --> 00:32:03.870
What the hell are you doing?

00:32:03.870 --> 00:32:05.870
Wait, look, let's try again and if not my mother will cut it off.

00:32:05.870 --> 00:32:11.090
Okay.

00:32:11.090 --> 00:32:13.090
Let's see if I can touch her.

00:32:13.090 --> 00:32:22.960
What's going on?

00:32:22.960 --> 00:32:24.960
The mask doesn't end.

00:32:24.960 --> 00:32:26.970
The difference between the mask and your skin cannot be distinguished.

00:32:26.970 --> 00:32:28.970
I can't put my hand in it.

00:32:28.970 --> 00:32:30.000
That's crazy.

00:32:30.350 --> 00:32:42.720
- It can't be. - Marina, there is no separation, it won't be the end.

00:32:42.720 --> 00:32:47.250
- I'm going to tell my mother. - Those eyes that I see...

00:32:47.250 --> 00:32:49.990
- What's wrong with them? - They're not my eyes.

00:32:49.990 --> 00:32:53.650
- My eyes aren't like that. - Try to calm down, Carly, look.

00:32:53.650 --> 00:32:56.000
- They're not my eyes. - My eyes...

00:32:56.000 --> 00:32:58.610
- Where am I? - Don't scare me.

00:32:58.610 --> 00:32:59.960
- I'm not...

00:33:00.030 --> 00:33:28.040
You're supposed to be me. You're supposed to be me, but you're supposed to be me, but you're not. Let's go! Please, come back! Please, come back!

00:34:02.330 --> 00:34:05.250
- I'm waiting for you. - I can't take it off.

00:34:05.250 --> 00:34:06.570
- I know.

00:34:06.570 --> 00:34:09.800
- Please, take it off. I want to take it off.

00:34:09.800 --> 00:34:12.930
- I can't do it. I can't take off your mask.

00:34:12.930 --> 00:34:17.410
- Why can't you? Don't go! Answer me!

00:34:17.410 --> 00:34:19.410
- I can't take off that mask!

00:34:19.410 --> 00:34:25.250
- It's not a mask. It's a real face.

00:34:25.250 --> 00:34:29.860
- I don't understand.

00:34:31.820 --> 00:34:32.720
How is that possible?

00:34:32.720 --> 00:34:35.140
At first, they weren't ugly masks.

00:34:35.140 --> 00:34:40.170
They were precious.

00:34:40.170 --> 00:34:42.320
Precious as any face.

00:34:42.320 --> 00:34:48.690
But something went wrong.

00:34:48.690 --> 00:34:51.060
They were...

00:34:51.060 --> 00:34:52.850
They were horrible.

00:34:52.850 --> 00:34:59.960
Once again, despite all my efforts to stop the process,

00:35:00.860 --> 00:35:10.110
And if I did what I did, the deformity, the ugliness, the monstrosity would arise.

00:35:10.110 --> 00:35:13.550
I don't believe any of that!

00:35:13.550 --> 00:35:22.320
I call them "the unloved" because no one will ever love them anymore.

00:35:22.320 --> 00:35:27.400
No one. Only you, Carly.

00:35:30.030 --> 00:35:35.440
You are the only person who has loved them, the only one who has loved them.

00:35:35.440 --> 00:35:44.120
No!

00:35:44.120 --> 00:35:46.870
Oliver, I'm sorry.

00:35:46.870 --> 00:35:50.870
You are so, it's now your turn.

00:36:06.010 --> 00:36:09.600
There may be a possibility.

00:36:09.600 --> 00:36:17.380
How many times have you removed the mask?

00:36:17.380 --> 00:36:23.280
It can still be possible.

00:36:23.280 --> 00:36:26.450
I can't take it off.

00:36:26.450 --> 00:36:27.910
Only you can do it.

00:36:30.320 --> 00:36:32.020
with a symbol of love.

00:36:32.020 --> 00:36:35.500
What does that mean?

00:36:35.500 --> 00:36:36.220
I don't...

00:36:36.220 --> 00:36:37.970
I don't understand what it means!

00:36:37.970 --> 00:36:39.430
Who are you?

00:36:39.430 --> 00:36:41.370
You don't know all those things!

00:36:41.370 --> 00:36:46.450
I am the man who created those faces, Carlybeth.

00:36:46.450 --> 00:36:50.020
You made them?

00:36:50.020 --> 00:36:55.560
I didn't love myself.

00:36:55.560 --> 00:37:00.000
I made those faces to hide behind them, to hide my thoughts.

00:37:00.440 --> 00:37:06.880
This was what infected the faces and turned them into monsters.

00:37:06.880 --> 00:37:12.040
As is now happening to this face.

00:37:12.040 --> 00:37:20.840
Very soon it will join the other failures of the shelf.

00:37:20.840 --> 00:37:24.590
I do not dare to show you what is underneath.

00:37:24.590 --> 00:37:30.000
Or what are you going to do?

00:37:30.000 --> 00:37:38.680
Sadie will do it, you can appreciate who you are and what you've always had

00:37:38.680 --> 00:37:43.060
I want to do it again!

00:37:43.060 --> 00:37:44.060
Shut up! Shut up!

00:37:44.060 --> 00:37:46.970
You're going to wake them up

00:37:46.970 --> 00:37:52.710
What's going on? What are you doing?

00:37:52.710 --> 00:37:58.450
Run!

00:39:35.210 --> 00:39:37.360
I'm not Carly Bale!

00:39:37.360 --> 00:39:39.890
I'm not Carly Bale!

00:39:39.890 --> 00:39:41.420
It's me!

00:39:41.420 --> 00:39:42.890
Get out of here!

00:39:42.890 --> 00:39:43.860
Get out of here!

00:40:06.360 --> 00:40:11.810
It's just a mask, it's just that again!

00:40:11.810 --> 00:40:27.590
Symbol of love, that's what it was about, a symbol of love.

00:40:30.760 --> 00:40:31.220
Thank you.

00:41:09.950 --> 00:41:11.950
Please take off that mask, Carly, come on.

00:41:11.950 --> 00:41:14.500
Please take off the mask.

00:41:14.500 --> 00:41:21.190
I got you, I got you, I got you.

00:41:21.190 --> 00:41:24.870
Here you are.

00:41:24.870 --> 00:41:27.110
Do you know what time it is?

00:41:27.110 --> 00:41:27.840
But mom...

00:41:30.350 --> 00:41:35.580
- What happened? - Sorry, mom, I didn't mean to scare you.

00:41:35.580 --> 00:41:38.850
I had a very strange night, but it's all over now.

00:41:38.850 --> 00:41:41.660
Why didn't you wear your duck costume?

00:41:41.660 --> 00:41:43.660
And why weren't you with Sabrina, daughter?

00:41:43.660 --> 00:41:45.620
I called you twice.

00:41:45.620 --> 00:41:51.760
Well, I learned a lot about myself tonight.

00:42:01.630 --> 00:42:04.190
No, don't put that mask on.

00:42:04.190 --> 00:42:06.810
Frankie, I won't put it on.

00:42:06.810 --> 00:42:08.200
What are you up to?

00:42:08.200 --> 00:42:10.590
Trick or treat!

00:42:14.790 --> 00:42:18.470
Why wasn't I so scared, right?

00:42:18.470 --> 00:42:21.640
I'll ask my family. Mom? Dad?

00:42:21.640 --> 00:42:28.160
What did you think? Did you like it?

00:42:28.160 --> 00:42:30.000
And you too, right?

00:42:30.440 --> 00:42:32.020
Is it a day of fear?
